---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteResume from '../components/SiteResume.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="学习" kicker="KianOS" active="home">
  <SiteResume />
  <div class="subjectEntries globalEntries">
    <section><span>Politics</span><h2><a href={`${base}politics/`}>政治 →</a></h2><p>从当前问题进入原课，再用题目验证。</p><nav><a href={`${base}politics/`}>五科学习</a><a href={`${base}politics/practice/`}>肖1000 Workbench</a></nav></section>
    <section><span>English</span><h2><a href={`${base}english/`}>English →</a></h2><p>完整做题、翻译与写作，按需查阅 Guide。</p><nav><a href={`${base}reading/`}>Objective</a><a href={`${base}translation/`}>Translation</a><a href={`${base}writing/`}>Writing</a></nav></section>
    <section><span>Xizong</span><h2><a href={`${base}xizong/`}>西医综合 →</a></h2><p>System Guide → 连续讲义 → Recall 与修补。</p><nav><a href={`${base}xizong/circulation/`}>A1 循环</a><a href={`${base}xizong/respiratory/`}>A2 呼吸</a><a href={`${base}xizong/urinary/`}>A3 泌尿</a></nav></section>
  </div>
  <p class="homeLexical"><a href={`${base}vocabulary/`}>Lexical 查词与参考 →</a></p>
</Base>
